{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Praxis with a degree-96 cyclotomic Module-SIS ring",
  "claims": [
    "params.json is a parameter set of Praxis for the reference statement at 100-bit security whose ciphertext is 7935 MiB (7.7489 GiB) and whose time, one encryption plus one expected decryption, is 26237 million field multiplications (19806 and 6432), by the protected model, and every rule of the model as amended holds for it; proof.md proves that each amended entry (n, Ncmp, H3, n2, dec_msm_g1, dec_msm_g2, dec_pairings, n1, P1, dec_sum_g1, C5) is sound, so that the paper's theorems hold for these parameters as rules.md requires."
  ],
